[gd_scene load_steps=11 format=3]

[ext_resource type="PackedScene" path="res://scenes/player/Player.tscn" id="1_player"]

; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
; Movement test bench. Collision geometry only: no sprites, no tiles, no art.
;
; Convention: every platform body is 40 px thick, so a platform whose walking
; surface is at y = T has its StaticBody2D at (centre_x, T + 20).
; The player uses a feet origin (12 x 20 box centred at y = -10), so standing
; on a surface means player.y == T, and its box spans x-6 .. x+6.
;
; Reachability from res://resources/PlayerConfig.tres (max_speed 150,
; jump_velocity -300, gravity 900, max_fall_speed 420):
;   continuous jump height   = 300^2 / (2 * 900)  = 50 px
;   measured peak at 60 ticks/s                   = 52.5 px (discrete overshoot)
;   air time, same height    = 2 * 300 / 900      = 0.667 s -> 100 px of reach
;   reach while climbing 36 px = 0.510 s           = 76.5 px
;   reach while falling 126 px = 0.959 s           = 143.8 px
; Layout, left to right (edge to edge distances):
;   StartIsland -> IslandGap1   48 px              small gap
;   IslandGap1  -> IslandStepUp 24 px + 36 px up   step onto a higher island
;   IslandStepUp-> IslandGap2   70 px              needs a full jump at speed
;   IslandGap2  -> IslandGap3   84 px              the hard gap, 16 px of slack
;   IslandGap3  -> IslandLanding 64 px + 126 px down  long fall, clamped by max_fall_speed
;   LowCeiling  spans x 1780..2000, y -4..36, above IslandLanding (surface y 90).
;               A standing player's head is at y 70, so the walkable headroom is
;               34 px: a held jump bonks the slab, a tapped jump passes under it.
; SafetyNet at y 240 catches every miss across the whole bench; WallLeft and
; WallRight close off both ends so nothing falls forever.
; ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

